From 44162937d37e7a3503a72d7c5de9bba08891edb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:51:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove the remaining Manus references from the frontend

The site now runs on Vercel against the Railway API, but the frontend still
carried Manus scaffolding:

- vercel.json proxied /manus-storage, /sitemap.xml and /robots.txt to the
  literal placeholder host REPLACE-WITH-RAILWAY-DOMAIN, so all three answered
  502 in production. Point them at the real API host, serve media under
  /storage, and keep /manus-storage as an alias for URLs already in the database.
- Drop the unused ManusDialog component ("Login with Manus").
- Drop the dist/__manus__ build guard and the Builder.io jsx-loc plugin, which
  only existed to tag elements for the Manus preview host.
- Replace the Manus preview hosts in the Vite dev allowedHosts with the real domains.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
